@startuml
skin rose
skinparam ArrowFontSize 12
hide empty description

[*] --> Command

state "Command mode" as Command
state "Navigation mode" as Navigation

Command --> Navigation : Esc / click a card list
Navigation --> Command : release I / click the command box\n/ choose a command row
Command --> Command : Up, Down / browse history
Navigation --> Navigation : J, K / move between cards\nS / switch view
@enduml
